// CandyOS Notes: the CandyOS-original note-taking app (docs/apps.md).
// Deliberately plain: Holo dark list + editor, one file per note in the
// app files dir, no dependencies. The framework Theme.Holo is the 4.4
// KitKat donor look (frameworks/base P1 series), so the action bar,
// lists and dialogs land KitKat-styled with zero custom styling.
android_app {
    name: "CandyNotes",
    product_specific: true,
    sdk_version: "current",
    srcs: ["src/**/*.kt"],
    resource_dirs: ["res"],
}